{
  "name": "644. BytePlus Seedance video: a create with no text reaches Ark when it has an image, video or audio Ark takes alone (byteplus seedance create without text)",
  "description": "Local fixture regression, no live provider calls: start tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs, start an isolated gateway on tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json and run with providerErrorFixture=1; every case is skipped otherwise. Ark's create-task reference makes the text optional beside an image, a video, an audio clip or a draft task, takes audio alone on the Seedance 2.5 series and refuses it on the 2.0 series. Rows 2 to 4: a first frame alone on dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628, a reference audio alone on the same model, and a reference image alone on dreamina-seedance-2-0-260128 each return a queued task; before the change all three were refused with 400 before Ark. Row 5 proves the three creates reached Ark with no text item. Row 6: a reference audio alone on dreamina-seedance-2-0-260128 is refused with 400 caller_invalid_request; row 7: a create with no prompt and nothing to generate from is refused with 400. Row 8 proves neither reached Ark.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "644.1 reset the fixture's counters and wire capture (byteplus seedance create without text)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}/__reset"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('the fixture reset its counters', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data[0].reset).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "644.2 byteplus POST /v1/videos takes a first frame with no prompt on dreamina-seedance-2-5 (byteplus seedance create without text)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"byteplus/dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628\",\n  \"input_reference\": \"https://example.test/first.png\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/videos",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "videos"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('the create returns a queued task', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.id, 'id: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('cgt-fixture-video-task:byteplus');",
              "  pm.expect(j.status, 'status: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('queued');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
